 "avatar": "9821c205fe68a8288b2cffae0247733eeb55c13c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really cool game, buy it with friends", "timestamp_created": 1636975033, "timestamp_updated": 1636975033, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102816303", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028191842", "personaname": "Haepax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Haepax/", "num_games_owned": 313, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 2563, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 316, "last_played": 1788521367, "avatar": "6c9bf1c6a36be648d677be85c01be519c8a1d4e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "👍🔫", "timestamp_created": 1636969118, "timestamp_updated": 1636969118, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102813783", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084385268", "personaname": "RAID Noir", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/541256325896/", "num_games_owned": 4215, "num_reviews": 284, "playtime_forever": 5947, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5900, "last_played": 1638130879, "avatar": "d7016256c643aa27c1680e558868979ed97963ab"}, "language": "english", "review": "Before the actual release I already played the game nearly 100 hours with a single run around 45 minutes.\n\nFor reference Slay the Spire was the ONLY other EA(Early Access) game that made me play 100+ hours before the actual release. That's How good this game was for me\n\nIts a FPS Roguelite with some similarities of weapon hunting from Borderlands franchise as well as Skill mechanics. \n\nThe game is simple but addictive and fun even though areas are repetitive i didn't feel  tired of replaying since there are also different characters to play as and each difficulty does bring something a bit different. As a SP game its competitive enough to track your play time and as a MP its very fun and feels better when you are relaxing and not aiming for something unless you are with close friends\n\nThe only other roguelite FPS i played was Void Bastards . Which I only played around 12+ hours since the premise was still the same in every run along with a tendency to have a pattern in every place you visit.\n\nPros\n- One of the best EA games from Steam same rank for me as Slay the Spire\n- Playing as SP and MP is fun\n- Multiple characters does change some of the gameplay but you can still pick the one suited for your play style\n- Devs listened and updated the final boss to not be a toin coss\n\nCons\n- None", "timestamp_created": 1636963389, "timestamp_updated": 1638130853, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 81, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.797830641269683838", "comment_count": 5, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 5}, {"reaction_type": 20, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102812871", "author": {"steamid": "76561198937842230", "personaname": "gooby", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gooby_q/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 46895, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1272, "last_played": 1786118308, "avatar": "e35b436b2ad9ddf56deff6c7235bccc74ce96b6c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun, would